From c5c62078bcb7364b23d122c5a159d66157cd31eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KontentOS Dev <dev@kontentos.local>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:11:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix production deploy: serve dist/, real Dockerfiles,
 fail-closed build

- server.ts: in production serve dist/ (static + SPA fallback + COOP/COEP headers)
  instead of always starting the Vite dev server; load vite lazily in dev only.
- package.json: tsx -> dependencies (start command needs it; NODE_ENV=production
  npm ci skipped devDependencies so the container crashed on boot);
  build = tsc --noEmit && vite build.
- Dockerfile (root + KontentOS-App): multi-stage, build fails on any error
  (no placeholder page), copy src/ into runtime (server imports from it),
  npm ci --ignore-scripts. Root Dockerfile builds from KontentOS-App/ so the
  existing Render settings keep working.
- .dockerignore: keep unrelated folders out of the root build context.
---
