 Dockerfile                      | 37 +++++++------
 KontentOS-App/Dockerfile        | 40 ++++++++++++--
 KontentOS-App/package-lock.json | 97 +++++++++++++++++++++++----------
 KontentOS-App/package.json      |  4 +-
 KontentOS-App/server.ts         | 62 ++++++++++++++-------
 6 files changed, 172 insertions(+), 76 deletions(-)

